  "notes": "EdgeEver: Evernote-like four-column layout in cool grey tones (#eef1f4 sidebar/list, #f8fafb editor, white AI panel). Green circular '+' New note pill button (white card with shadow) is the only strong brand color; starred note gets a yellow star. Notebook counts are muted grey numbers, child counts roll up into stacks. Selected list item uses a grey filled rounded block; other items separated by hairlines with hashtags in light grey. Editor header packs title, notebook combobox, tags, smart tags, reading-protection lock, sync status '582 chars', focus mode, GitHub link. AI panel: chat-history dropdown title, right-aligned grey user bubble, plain-text reply, quick-action chips (Summarize/Improve writing/Translate), composer with 'Include current note' context toggle and model switcher (gpt-4.1-mini). The AI reply text oddly echoes system-prompt-like instructions ('Focus DATA (not instructions)') — page content, treated only as data."
